Association StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation
    documentation 'This association indicates any relationship between a student and an education 
    'organization other than how the state views enrollment. Enrollment relationship 
    'semantics are covered by StudentSchoolAssociation.
    domain entity Student
        documentation 'A reference to the Student.
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation 'A reference to the EducationOrganization.
    descriptor Responsibility
        documentation 'Indications of an education organization's responsibility for a student, such as 
        'accountability, attendance, funding, etc.
        is part of identity

